{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Little Spider is a digital companion for those long days at work, intense study sessions, or chill evenings.\u00a0 Watch your new companion collect bugs as you do other things, and pitch in here and there when you have a minute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854330/extras/96735bcca6d51a10f1cb4ed1b0446590.poster.avif?t=1759932632\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854330/extras/96735bcca6d51a10f1cb4ed1b0446590.webm?t=1759932632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854330/extras/96735bcca6d51a10f1cb4ed1b0446590.mp4?t=1759932632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete the Bugopedia!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 cute bugs to discover and collect   in your web.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bugs only come out at certain times of day, so pay attention to the in-game clock!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854330/extras/5c8cad07eb8ba333c55444360ccfc6db.poster.avif?t=1759932632\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854330/extras/5c8cad07eb8ba333c55444360ccfc6db.webm?t=1759932632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854330/extras/5c8cad07eb8ba333c55444360ccfc6db.mp4?t=1759932632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel to different Biomes!</strong></p><ul c